AUDIO: 'studio, I selected UGC ad and pasted one of the prompts. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; In the product section, I simply pasted the Amazon product link, and Loom Flow automatically imported the product'

[09:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'details. This script called for a 25-year-old female creator, so I selected a matching AI avatar. You can also upload your own character if you prefer. Finally, I chose the video settings, set'

[09:24] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the duration to 15 seconds, &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; selected the resolution, and clicked generate. A few moments later, the ad was ready. &gt;&gt; I used to leave the house with just coffee.'

[09:36] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'But now, this is my secret weapon. Twist and blend, 600 watts power, done in seconds. Healthy, quick, and ready to go. Seriously, you need this. And honestly, &gt;&gt; [music]'

[09:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; this is pretty impressive. In less than 5 minutes, I had my first complete UGC ad. Here are a few of the results. I never used to eat spinach, but watch this. Spinach smoothie. &gt;&gt; Every blender I tried left these annoying fruit chunks. This one actually'

[10:03] [scene:talk]
