[10:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'fraction of the time. &gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; This is what I mean by scale-driven production. Instead of investing all your effort into one commercial, the goal [music] is to quickly create multiple concepts and marketing angles for the same product. With the product'

[10:29] [scene:talk]
